{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭周五表示，其軍事部隊使用的星鏈（Starlink）通信系統仍然受到速度限制，與美國總統當勞·特朗普此前宣稱服務已恢復的説法相矛盾。自10月13日以來，星鏈實施的限制使無人機無法以超過每小時160公裏的速度飛行，妨礙了烏克蘭軍隊的作戰行動。華盛頓多次否認人為限制星鏈連接速度，而烏克蘭總統弗拉基米爾·澤連斯基則堅稱，這些限制是有意實施的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583590.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.174436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:17:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.993409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.993409+00:00","content_hash":"edcffcd2cbed1dfe85196ad702480ec442aaa51ea606a850d6b8214976ed383b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}